sequenceDiagram

    autonumber

    actor Customer as Customer

    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as Spring Boot API
    participant Auth as Spring Security
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant Inventory as Inventory Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Payment as Payment Gateway

    %% ==========================================
    %% LOGIN
    %% ==========================================

    Customer->>FE: Đăng nhập

    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login

    API->>Auth: Xác thực username/password

    Auth->>DB: Kiểm tra USER

    DB-->>Auth: User information

    Auth-->>API: JWT Token

    API-->>FE: JWT Token

    FE-->>Customer: Đăng nhập thành công


    %% ==========================================
    %% VIEW PRODUCT
    %% ==========================================

    Customer->>FE: Xem sản phẩm

    FE->>API: GET /api/products

    API->>DB: Query products

    DB-->>API: Product list

    API-->>FE: Product list

    FE-->>Customer: Hiển thị sản phẩm


    %% ==========================================
    %% ADD CART
    %% ==========================================

    Customer->>FE: Thêm sản phẩm vào giỏ

    FE->>API: POST /api/cart/items

    API->>DB: Kiểm tra PRODUCT

    DB-->>API: Product information

    API->>DB: INSERT / UPDATE CART_ITEM

    DB-->>API: Cart updated

    API-->>FE: Cart updated

    FE-->>Customer: Hiển thị giỏ hàng


    %% ==========================================
    %% CREATE ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    Customer->>FE: Nhấn "Đặt hàng"

    FE->>API: POST /api/orders

    API->>Auth: Validate JWT

    Auth-->>API: User authenticated

    API->>Order: Create order

    Order->>DB: Get CART_ITEM

    DB-->>Order: Cart items


    %% ==========================================
    %% CHECK INVENTORY
    %% ==========================================

    Order->>Inventory: Kiểm tra tồn kho

    Inventory->>DB: SELECT INVENTORY

    DB-->>Inventory: Current stock

    alt Đủ tồn kho

        Inventory-->>Order: Stock available

        Order->>DB: Create ORDERS

        Order->>DB: Create ORDER_DETAIL

        Order->>DB: Reserve stock

        DB-->>Order: Order created


        %% ======================================
        %% PAYMENT
        %% ======================================

        Order->>Payment: Create payment

        Payment-->>Order: Payment URL

        Order-->>API: Payment URL

        API-->>FE: Payment URL

        FE-->>Customer: Chuyển đến thanh toán


        Customer->>Payment: Thanh toán

        Payment-->>API: Payment callback

        API->>Order: Update payment status

        Order->>DB: UPDATE PAYMENT

        Order->>DB: UPDATE ORDER

        Order->>Inventory: Confirm stock deduction

        Inventory->>DB: UPDATE INVENTORY

        DB-->>Inventory: Stock updated

        Inventory-->>Order: Inventory updated

        Order-->>API: Order completed

        API-->>FE: Order successful

        FE-->>Customer: Đặt hàng thành công

    else Không đủ tồn kho

        Inventory-->>Order: Insufficient stock

        Order-->>API: Out of stock

        API-->>FE: 400 - Không đủ tồn kho

        FE-->>Customer: Thông báo hết hàng

    end